          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fed7aa;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f97316;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">Submit Scenario</span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#92400e;\">Status: Submitted</span></div><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff7ed;font-size:7px;color:#c2410c;\">\u270f\ufe0f Komentar: Siap di-review untuk production</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Approve oleh Reviewer",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 **Reviewer** melihat rule yang perlu di-approve\n\u2022 Bisa melihat detail rule: parameter, flow, konfigurasi\n\u2022 **Approve** \u2014 setuju, rule siap diaktivasi\n\u2022 **Reject** \u2014 tolak dengan alasan, rule dikembalikan ke pembuat",
          "color": "#22c55e",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:5px;background:#22c55e;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">\u2705 Approve</span><span style=\"padding:5px 14px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">\u274c Reject</span></div>"
